message: "Please cite this software version when using or discussing the implementation."
type: software
title: "Factor-Adjusted Smoothed Rank Estimation for High-Dimensional Accelerated Failure Time Models: Research Software"
authors:
  - family-names: Zhu
    given-names: Weineng
  - family-names: Ju
    given-names: Yang
version: "0.17.0"
date-released: 2026-10-14
repository-code: "https://github.com/notthats1mple/Factor-Adjusted-Smoothed-Rank-Estimation-for-High-Dimensional-Accelerated-Failure-Time-Models"
url: "https://github.com/notthats1mple/Factor-Adjusted-Smoothed-Rank-Estimation-for-High-Dimensional-Accelerated-Failure-Time-Models"
abstract: >-
  R research software for factor-adjusted, partially penalized smoothed
  Gehan estimation in high-dimensional accelerated failure time models.
  Includes training preprocessing, proximal-gradient and FISTA solvers,
  fixed-active-face Newton refinement, complete KKT diagnostics,
  frozen prediction, and training-validation components.
keywords:
  - accelerated failure time model
  - right censoring
  - factor adjustment
  - smoothed Gehan loss
  - partial L1 penalty
  - numerical optimization
  - R
